            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reviews</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >”…even in its current state, it’s already one of the more captivating multiplayer shooters on Steam right now.” <strong>IGN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“BattleBit has echoes of what Eric Barone did with Stardew Valley: a small game that punches above its weight and wins people over with unexpected depth and quality.” <strong>PC Gamer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“If you’ve grown tired of extraction shooters and battle royale games and crave something more focused on gunplay, combat, and just having fun over grinding and seasons, I’d recommend <i>BattleBit Remastered</i>.” <strong>Kotaku</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into chaotic, large-scale FPS battles with up to 254 players in <i>BattleBit Remastered</i>! Whether you're storming enemy positions with Assault or building critical defences as support, every role counts in this low-poly, adrenaline-pumping battleground. Squad up with open VOIP and level cities with fully destructible environments. Ready to experience the ultimate team-based warfare?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Primary features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible Environment<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/8cff82274c102c808f6befc81329c82d.poster.avif?t=1730393449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/8cff82274c102c808f6befc81329c82d.webm?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/8cff82274c102c808f6befc81329c82d.mp4?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Tear down walls, collapse buildings, and reshape the battlefield with dynamic 'levolution' mechanics, where every action leaves a lasting impact on the world around you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable weapons (WIP)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/ae6dfbe685917e39f5d2d4468f494a74.poster.avif?t=1730393449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/ae6dfbe685917e39f5d2d4468f494a74.webm?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/ae6dfbe685917e39f5d2d4468f494a74.mp4?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Tailor your arsenal to your playstyle in <i>BattleBit Remastered</i>! Modify everything from scopes to grips or barrels to mags. Create the perfect weapon loadout to dominate every battleground.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >254 Player serve<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/611117d20181595cbd811c9fa4f71487.poster.avif?t=1730393449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/611117d20181595cbd811c9fa4f71487.webm?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/611117d20181595cbd811c9fa4f71487.mp4?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Join the chaos with up to 254 players in epic, large-scale battles! <i>BattleBit Remastered</i> offers massive multiplayer servers where proximity-based voice chat brings every encounter to life! Coordinate strategies or taunt the enemy as you fight for control in the ever-evolving battleground!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicular combat with tanks, helicopters, transports, and sea vehicle<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/2a3d88b00e1fda35b473ad6016327d4d.poster.avif?t=1730393449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/2a3d88b00e1fda35b473ad6016327d4d.webm?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/2a3d88b00e1fda35b473ad6016327d4d.mp4?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Dominate the battlefield with an arsenal of vehicles at your command! From tanks and helicopters to transports and sea vessels, <i>BattleBit Remastered</i> delivers intense vehicular combat that adds new layers of strategy and chaos to every fight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reviews</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >”…even in its current state, it’s already one of the more captivating multiplayer shooters on Steam right now.” <strong>IGN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“BattleBit has echoes of what Eric Barone did with Stardew Valley: a small game that punches above its weight and wins people over with unexpected depth and quality.” <strong>PC Gamer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“If you’ve grown tired of extraction shooters and battle royale games and crave something more focused on gunplay, combat, and just having fun over grinding and seasons, I’d recommend <i>BattleBit Remastered</i>.” <strong>Kotaku</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into chaotic, large-scale FPS battles with up to 254 players in <i>BattleBit Remastered</i>! Whether you're storming enemy positions with Assault or building critical defences as support, every role counts in this low-poly, adrenaline-pumping battleground. Squad up with open VOIP and level cities with fully destructible environments. Ready to experience the ultimate team-based warfare?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Primary features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible Environment<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/8cff82274c102c808f6befc81329c82d.poster.avif?t=1730393449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/8cff82274c102c808f6befc81329c82d.webm?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/8cff82274c102c808f6befc81329c82d.mp4?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Tear down walls, collapse buildings, and reshape the battlefield with dynamic 'levolution' mechanics, where every action leaves a lasting impact on the world around you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable weapons (WIP)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/ae6dfbe685917e39f5d2d4468f494a74.poster.avif?t=1730393449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/ae6dfbe685917e39f5d2d4468f494a74.webm?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/ae6dfbe685917e39f5d2d4468f494a74.mp4?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Tailor your arsenal to your playstyle in <i>BattleBit Remastered</i>! Modify everything from scopes to grips or barrels to mags. Create the perfect weapon loadout to dominate every battleground.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >254 Player serve<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/611117d20181595cbd811c9fa4f71487.poster.avif?t=1730393449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/611117d20181595cbd811c9fa4f71487.webm?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/611117d20181595cbd811c9fa4f71487.mp4?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Join the chaos with up to 254 players in epic, large-scale battles! <i>BattleBit Remastered</i> offers massive multiplayer servers where proximity-based voice chat brings every encounter to life! Coordinate strategies or taunt the enemy as you fight for control in the ever-evolving battleground!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicular combat with tanks, helicopters, transports, and sea vehicle<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/2a3d88b00e1fda35b473ad6016327d4d.poster.avif?t=1730393449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/2a3d88b00e1fda35b473ad6016327d4d.webm?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/2a3d88b00e1fda35b473ad6016327d4d.mp4?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Dominate the battlefield with an arsenal of vehicles at your command! From tanks and helicopters to transports and sea vessels, <i>BattleBit Remastered</i> delivers intense vehicular combat that adds new layers of strategy and chaos to every fight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
